  "description": "Rodeo Ranger – Western Slab Serif Font\nRodeo Ranger is a bold and rugged western slab serif font inspired by classic Old West posters, vintage rodeo signs, saloon branding, and retro athletic lettering. With its heavy strokes, strong slab serifs, and softly rounded corners, this typeface delivers a confident, nostalgic, and handcrafted look that stands out instantly.\nThis all-caps display font is perfect for headlines, logos, t-shirt designs, posters, labels, packaging, and any project that needs a powerful vintage character. The soft rounded edges give it a printed, letterpress-inspired feel, making it ideal for both digital and print use.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Rodeo Ranger – Western Slab Serif Font</p>\n<p>Rodeo Ranger is a bold and rugged western slab serif font inspired by classic Old West posters, vintage rodeo signs, saloon branding, and retro athletic lettering. With its heavy strokes, strong slab serifs, and softly rounded corners, this typeface delivers a confident, nostalgic, and handcrafted look that stands out instantly.</p>\n<p>This all-caps display font is perfect for headlines, logos, t-shirt designs, posters, labels, packaging, and any project that needs a powerful vintage character. The soft rounded edges give it a printed, letterpress-inspired feel, making it ideal for both digital and print use.</p>",
